[[631,254,"There were issues with communication and record keeping which impacted on the quality and effectiveness of the searches undertaken","inadequate search coordination",""],[632,254,"The location of the first NPAS heat source was not recorded accurately","inaccurate location recording",""],[633,254,"The outcome of the search into the first NPAS heat source was not recorded accurately by the Officers involved or the call handler","incomplete search documentation",""],[634,254,"The details of the second NPAS heat source were not heeded","neglected heat source",""],[635,254,"There was no liaison between Hartlepool and Stockton officers during the search","lack of inter‑agency liaison",""],[636,254,"There were delays in requesting Polsa Mutual Aid from neighbouring police forces","delayed mutual aid request",""],[637,254,"There were delays in requesting the involvement of Mountain Rescue","delayed mountain rescue request",""],[638,254,"the officer who was guided by NPAS to the first heat source did not have a full set of operational PPE for a search at night time in a dense area","inadequate personal protective equipment",""]]